{"Title":"An Act in support of veterans and dependents through municipal tax bills","BillNumber":"H3493","DocketNumber":"HD1315","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MJC1","Name":"Mark J. Cusack","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJC1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T12:59:31.513"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MJC1","Name":"Mark J. Cusack","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJC1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T12:59:31.5133333"},{"Id":"V_H1","Name":"Vanna Howard","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/V_H1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-31T10:58:47.17"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3493/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Cusack of Braintree, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3493) of Mark J. Cusack and Vanna Howard relative to voluntary contribution check-off boxes on municipal tax bills for support of local veterans’ agents.  Veterans and Federal Affairs.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1.  Any city or town in the Commonwealth may, subject to the approvals of the commissioner of revenue and the legislative body of the city or town, designate a place on its municipal tax bills, or the motor vehicle excise tax bills, or mail with such tax bills a separate form whereby taxpayers of the city or town can voluntarily check off, donate and pledge an amount of money which shall increase the amount already due and which shall be paid over to an account under the supervision of the local veterans agent for the support of veterans and dependents in need. \r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J31"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}